OL,3,GNEWSAStroke patient, 80, could be
OL,4,Aplaced in care 100 miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man stuck in hospital
OL,7,Ffor 16 months have been told he could
OL,8,Fbe placed in a care home 100 miles
OL,9,Faway.
OL,11,FJohn Russell, from Oban, was admitted
OL,12,Fto the town's Lorn & Islands Hospital
OL,13,Flast year after he suffered a stroke.
OL,15,FHis wife Teresa, 79, said she was
OL,16,Fprepared to care for him at home with
OL,17,Fsome help, but his discharge from
OL,18,Fhospital was delayed and his health has
OL,19,Fdeteriorated.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
