OL,3,GNEWSAStroke patient, 80, could be
OL,4,Aplaced in care 100 miles from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeresa, who uses a wheelchair and a
OL,7,Fwalking frame, said she had been told
OL,8,Fthat because John needs 24-hour care he
OL,9,Fcould be moved to a home in Edinburgh -
OL,10,Fwhich is about 93 miles away by train
OL,11,For 122 miles by road.
